Correct the VIF/GIF boundary while preserving the existing fragmented VIF assembler and PS2Memory ABI.
Behavioral reference: https://github.com/drakolordx7/KillzoneRecomp/blob/master/patches/ps2recomp/0005-vif1-direct-image-continuation.patch
Reorganizes the pinned SDK existing IMAGE wrapping into DIRECT payload processing; no new runtime or game overrides.

